 "name_en": "Product Change Mgmt with Change Records – Discrete Industries (64E)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Product Change Mgmt with Change Records – Discrete Industries (64E)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0d959c3042c248d0b33545a2591263c4\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0d959c3042c248d0b33545a2591263c4__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> for product change management with change records flexibly orchestrates the management of enterprise product changes. It can handle several types of objects that are affected by the intended changes, such as materials, BOMs, master recipes, and documents. The change record keeps all information in one place. The progress of the change is controlled by a dedicated status management, and the change process is supported by workflow capabilities of process routing. Collaboration using comments during the change process allows effective communication with all involved parties.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0d959c3042c248d0b33545a2591263c4__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create change record</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Start workflow</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review change request (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign master recipes and products</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign classification and attachments</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve or reject change record</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Modify validity date in change master</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform design changes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform product master changes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform engineering structure changes</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0d959c3042c248d0b33545a2591263c4__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Handle various object types with and without change numbers and model workflows flexibly</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Gain transparency with visual workflow capability combined with a status-driven change control</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve efficiency with all change information in one easy-to-navigate place</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get a single source of truth of all the data involved in a change</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Drive the change process efficiently through best practices and workflow templates</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Allow ad-hoc communication with stakeholders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Leverage insights from engineering cockpit</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用变更记录的产品变更管理 - 离散行业 (64E)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0d959c3042c248d0b33545a2591263c4\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0d959c3042c248d0b33545a2591263c4__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">面向产品变更管理的 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 具有变更记录，可灵活协调企业产品变更管理。它可以处理受预期更改影响的多种类型的对象，例如物料、物料清单、主配方和文档。变更记录将所有信息保存在一个位置。变更进度由专用状态管理控制，变更流程由工艺路线的工作流功能支持。在变更流程中使用注释进行协作可以与所有相关方进行有效沟通。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0d959c3042c248d0b33545a2591263c4__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建变更记录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">启动工作流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审核变更请求（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分配主配方和产品</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分配分类和附件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">批准或拒绝变更记录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">修改变更主数据中的有效日期</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行设计变更</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行产品主数据变更</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行工程结构更改</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0d959c3042c248d0b33545a2591263c4__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">灵活处理各种对象类型，无论是否有变更编号和模型工作流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">借助可视化的工作流功能和状态驱动的变更控制功能，提高透明度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在一个易于导航的位置获取所有变更信息，提高效率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获取变更所涉及的所有数据的单一真实数据源。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">利用卓越实践和工作流模板，高效推动变更流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">允许与利益相关方进行即席通信</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">利用工程主控室中的洞察</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
